{"id":"torrey:months","source":"torrey","name":"Months","slug":"months","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Sun and moon designed to mark out — Ge 1:14.","refs":[["Gen",1,14,1,14]]},{"text":"The patriarchs computed time by — Ge 29:14.","refs":[["Gen",29,14,29,14]]},{"text":"The Jews computed time by — Jdj 11:37; 1Sa 6:1; 1Ki 4:7.","refs":[["Judg",11,37,11,37],["1Sam",6,1,6,1],["1Kgs",4,7,4,7]]},{"text":"Commenced with first appearance of new moon — Nu 10:10; Ps 81:3.","refs":[["Num",10,10,10,10],["Ps",81,3,81,3]]},{"text":"Originally had no names — Ge 7:11; 8:4.","refs":[["Gen",7,11,7,11],["Gen",8,4,8,4]]},{"text":"The year composed of twelve — 1Ch 27:2-15; Es 2:12; Re 22:2.","refs":[["1Chr",27,2,27,15],["Esth",2,12,2,12],["Rev",22,2,22,2]]},{"text":"First, Nisan or Abib. — Ex 13:4; Ne 2:1.","refs":[["Exod",13,4,13,4],["Neh",2,1,2,1]]},{"text":"Second, Zif. — 1Ki 6:1,37.","refs":[["1Kgs",6,1,6,1],["1Kgs",6,37,6,37]]},{"text":"Third, Sivan. — Es 8:9.","refs":[["Esth",8,9,8,9]]},{"text":"Fourth, Tammuz. — Zec 8:19.","refs":[["Zech",8,19,8,19]]},{"text":"Fifth, Av. — Zec 7:3.","refs":[["Zech",7,3,7,3]]},{"text":"Sixth, Elul. — Ne 6:15.","refs":[["Neh",6,15,6,15]]},{"text":"Seventh, Ethanim. — 1Ki 8:2.","refs":[["1Kgs",8,2,8,2]]},{"text":"Eighth, Bul. — 1Ki 6:38.","refs":[["1Kgs",6,38,6,38]]},{"text":"Ninth, Chisleu. — Zec 7:1.","refs":[["Zech",7,1,7,1]]},{"text":"Tenth, Tebeth. — Es 2:16.","refs":[["Esth",2,16,2,16]]},{"text":"Eleventh, Sebat. — Zec 1:7.","refs":[["Zech",1,7,1,7]]},{"text":"Twelfth, Adar. — Ezr 6:15; Es 3:7.","refs":[["Ezra",6,15,6,15],["Esth",3,7,3,7]]},{"text":"Idolaters prognosticated by — Isa 47:13.","refs":[["Isa",47,13,47,13]]},{"text":"Observance of, condemned — Ga 4:10.","refs":[["Gal",4,10,4,10]]}],"refCount":29}
